(1245,'SM-231128-0002','-','applying for a clinical internship/clerkship at Royal Hospital Bali .','2023-11-24','2023-11-28','Direktur RSU. Bali Royal','1066','Dear Sirs and Madams\r\nHeraby I am applying for a clinical internship/clerkship at Royal Hospital Bali .\r\n \r\nYou will find my CV and cover letter in the attachments.\r\n \r\nI´m looking forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nYours sincerely\r\nJulia Plfug\r\n',1,1,'2023-11-28 04:42:57','2023-11-28 05:54:57',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'SDM dan Diklat untuk dikaji dan ditindaklanjuti','2023-11-28 05:54:57'),
(1246,'SM-231128-0003','-','4-week elective placement with your anaesthetics or orthopaedic surgery team from June 10 to July 5, 2024.','2023-11-23','2023-11-28','Direktur RSU. Bali Royal','1062','Good evening,\r\n\r\nI hope this email finds you well. I\'m writing to follow up on my previous inquiry about a 4-week elective placement with your anaesthetics or orthopaedic surgery team from June 10 to July 5, 2024.\r\n\r\nI\'m eager to proceed with the application process and would appreciate further information on eligibility criteria, documentation needed, and any prerequisites for international medical students. I have attached my CV, a letter of recommendation, passport copy, and ID photograph in my previous email.\r\n\r\nIf you need further details or have any questions, please feel free to contact me at macy.banks@student.manchester.ac.uk or +447976730847.\r\n\r\nThank you for your consideration. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to and learning from your medical team.\r\n\r\nSincerely, Macy Banks\r\n',1,1,'2023-11-28 04:44:07','2023-11-28 05:55:55',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'SDM dan Diklat untuk dikaji','2023-11-28 05:55:55'),
