(1299,'SM-240105-0006','-','medical internship at Bali Royal Hospital','2024-01-05','2024-01-05','Direktur RSU. Bali Royal','1088','I’m Nora, a fifth-semester medical student at the Medical School Berlin in Germany, and I\'m excited to express my interest in a medical internship at Bali Royal Hospital.\r\n\r\nIn 2019, during my Psychology Bachelor\'s, I had the opportunity to intern at a rehabilitation center in Chiang Mai in Thailand for half an year. This experience ignited my passion for patient care and has fuelled my desire to contribute to the medical field.\r\n\r\nI am excited about the possibility of combining my psychology background with my medical studies at Bali Royal Hospital. Also, working in an international environment is not only a professional but also a personal enrichment for me. I am available to start the internship either in mid February 2024 or August 2024 for a duration of 3-4 weeks, aligning with my university schedule.\r\n\r\nI would be grateful for an opportunity to discuss my application further at your convenience. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the possibility of joining the Bali Royal Hospital team.\r\n\r\nI have attached my CV and Bachelor\'s degree certificate for your reference.\r\n',1,1,'2024-01-05 07:27:35','2024-01-05 07:35:50',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'SDM dan Diklat dikaji','2024-01-05 07:35:50'),
