(1525,'SM-240606-0016','DIKIRIM VIA EMAIL MELALUI EMAIL INFO','Renewal Agreement with Asian Assistance ','2024-05-31','2024-06-03','Direktur RSU. Bali Royal','4453','Greetings from Asian Assistance. I am contacting you from our network department regarding an existing agreement we have that was signed back in 2015. We have since updated our agreement to include a data protection clause.   \r\n  \r\nI have attached the new agreement form in this email. Please review the new data protection clause under heading #10. If you have concerns or suggestions, please provide feedback. If you are in agreement, please return the document to us with the information in the fillable fields. We will then send you a final version of the agreement to be signed by both parties.  \r\n  \r\nIf you have any further questions, please don’t hesitate to contact me. I look forward to hearing back from you soon. Thank you in advance for your time and cooperation.   \r\n\r\n',1,1,'2024-06-06 03:55:25','2024-06-06 07:04:27',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'Marketing untuk dikaji dan ditindaklanjuti','2024-06-06 07:04:27'),
