(1576,'SM-240805-0001','DIKIRIM VIA EMAIL MELALUI EMAIL MARKETING','Smile Foundation of Bali 19th Anniversary','2024-08-02','2024-08-05','Direktur RSU. Bali Royal','912','Dear Friends of Smile Bali,\r\n\r\nWarmest Greeting\r\n\r\nWe are thrilled to announce that Yayasan Senyum Bali (Smile Foundation of Bali) is celebrating 19 years of transforming smiles and lives. We want to take this opportunity to express our deepest gratitude for your generous support over the years.\r\n\r\nTo show our appreciation, we warmly invite you to join us for our 19th Anniversary Celebration.\r\n\r\nEvent Details:\r\nDate: Friday, 9th August 2024\r\nTime: 10:00 AM – 12:00 PM\r\nVenue: Smile House, Jl. Pulau Aru No. 9, Sanglah, Denpasar\r\n\r\nPlease find the invitation and location details attached.\r\n\r\nKindly RSVP to (+62) 858-5887-0158 or email us at yayasansenyum@yahoo.co.id\r\n\r\nOnce again, we thank you for being a vital part of this journey. We look forward to welcoming you as our special guest.\r\n\r\n\r\nBest Regards,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSukma Dewi\r\nChair of Board of Management\r\nYayasan Senyum Bali (The Smile Foundation of Bali)\r\nJl. Pulau Aru No. 9\r\nSanglah Denpasar Bali 80114\r\n',1,1,'2024-08-05 04:19:23','2024-08-05 05:11:16',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'dr Prima dan marketing dikaji untuk bisa menghadiri ( koordinasi dengan panitia )','2024-08-05 05:11:16'),
